<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JAN 2.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, JAN 2.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Jan 02	Dec 31	DEC 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  245.390     247.020     247.020   -0.66 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  306.830     306.830     306.830    0.00 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.700     158.970     158.970   -0.17 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   47.078	47.182	47.182   -0.22 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  418.180     419.180     419.180   -0.24 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  141.425     141.685     141.685   -0.18 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   16.144	16.185	16.185   -0.25 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  211.770     212.430     212.430   -0.31 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.883	 1.888	 1.888   -0.26 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.579	 1.581	 1.581   -0.13 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  182.170     183.135     183.135   -0.53 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
